        <body>A ThicknessSizeDimension is the physical thickness of a ShapeElement. &lt;example&gt; The remaining thickness below a blind hole might be specified as a ThicknessSizeDimension. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; The thickness of a CoatingLayer is a ThicknessSizeDimension.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
