          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193827_142302_27762"/>
          <body> the words or set of words by which the MaterialPropertyDefinition is known. &lt;example&gt;'EM1' is an example for a name that may be associated with a MaterialPropertyValue that is described as 'elastic modulus' in description.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
