        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193061_205053_23496"/>
        <body>A DataEnvironment is a specification of the conditions under that a MaterialPropertyValue is valid. &lt;example&gt; A DataEnvironment may have the name 'standard', the description '20 degrees Celsius, 75% humidity' and links to the property objects that characterize 20 degrees Celsius and 75% humidity.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DataEnvironment</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193561_586505_25980" xmi:uuid="84f53ad1-4a77-43dd-a27e-af0b548fb896" xmi:type="uml:Property">
