          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193561_24077_25982"/>
          <body> the set of one or more PropertyValue that characterizes the environment. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;example&gt; Boiling point of water depends on pressure. An instance of PropertyValue may provide the pressure value that corresponds to a specific boiling temperature.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
